---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
import { DonationModule } from './DonationModule';
---

<section id="donaciones" class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-surface-container-low to-surface-container rounded-3xl shadow-sacred border border-surface-container p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decorative Ambient Circle -->
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-primary/5 pointer-events-none blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center relative z-10">
      <!-- Left Column: Pastoral Message on Generosity (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Corresponsabilidad Eclesial</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-charcoal font-bold leading-tight">
          Sostenimiento del Templo y Misión Evangelizadora
        </h2>

        <p class="text-charcoal-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
          Tu ofrenda voluntaria y generosa permite mantener encendida la lámpara del sagrario, conservar el patrimonio sacro, sustentar la iluminación y calefacción durante el culto, y financiar la entrega continua de alimentos a familias de Cáritas.
        </p>

        <!-- Bullet Highlights -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 pt-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-charcoal-muted text-xs">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Total transparencia en las cuentas parroquiales</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-charcoal-muted text-xs">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Deducción fiscal eclesiástica por donativo</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-charcoal-muted text-xs">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Mantenimiento de vitrales y campanario histórico</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-charcoal-muted text-xs">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Becas de campamentos para jóvenes sin recursos</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Interactive Donation Module (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <DonationModule client:load bankAccount={siteConfig.bankAccount} />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
